{"ts":"2026-09-28T21:41:30.384Z","type":"spawn.report","run":"run-20260928-191959","spec":"harness-control-pane","agent":"sdd-drafter","report":"I've sent the report to the orchestrator. Design v1 is 3,984 words, just under the 4,000 cap, and the codebase context file has new sections added at the end, with no existing lines touched.\n\nThings you'll want to look at:\n\n- **Four places where the design departs from the requirements:**\n  - Req 1 AC 4: a role the provider map sends to DeepSeek starts with the map's model filled in, not the declared Claude model. Otherwise the form fails validation as soon as it opens.\n  - Req 3 AC 13: removing the pointer line copies the supervisor's own `deregister.mjs` and adds a retry. It still isn't fully safe against a run appending its line at the same moment, and neither is `deregister.mjs`. Fully closing that gap would mean changing how the supervisor appends.\n  - Req 3 AC 14: if an existing worktree never finished its setup command, the setup runs again before the worktree is used, instead of the launch being refused.\n  - Req 2 AC 6: a setup file that won't parse is also refused and deleted, same as one with a bad provider map.\n- **The timeout the requirements mention is wrong:** it's a 15-minute constant; only its error message says 10 minutes. Either way, launched runs don't use it, and stopping the dashboard doesn't kill them.\n- **Left out on purpose:**\n  - The page only launches when routing names an active spec. Pending retrospectives, close-outs and the decomposition fallback still start from a terminal.\n  - A pointer line left by a crashed terminal run blocks page launches until someone removes it by hand; the page has no button for that.\n  - Logs are never cleaned up.\n- **The seven-step end-to-end check** needs a real `claude -p` run in a rebuilt, restarted session. It goes into `verification-evidence.md` as pending until someone runs it by hand.\n\nThe design records 16 decisions (D1–D16) for someone to confirm or overturn.\n\nFiles:\n- /home/mcf/repo/spec-workflow-mcp/.spec-workflow/specs/harness-control-pane/design.md\n- /home/mcf/repo/spec-workflow-mcp/.spec-workflow/specs/harness-control-pane/codebase-context.md","agentId":"aa238946107781f51"}
